{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Ujjaya","html":"<article id='thag1.47'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.47 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.47 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Pañcamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Five </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Ujjayattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ujjaya </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Namo te buddha vīratthu, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Homage to you, O Buddha, O hero, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vippamuttosi sabbadhi; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>freed in every way! </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tuyhāpadāne viharaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Meditating in the fruits of your practice, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>viharāmi anāsavo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I live without defilements. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Ujjayo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
